      "type": "service",
      "name": "gpu-ops-center.service",
      "filePath": "gpu-ops-center.service",
      "summary": "systemd 单元：WorkingDirectory=/opt/gpu-ops-center，ExecStart 用 node 直接跑 server/api.mjs（无需 npm），Restart=always 且 RestartSec=5，依赖 network-online.target，用于中心节点开机自启。",
      "tags": ["deploy", "systemd", "process-supervision"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
